<title>JAPAN: Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</title>
<headline>Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mikuni and Co Ltd said on Friday it had assigned the following preliminary ratings to planned bond issues:</p>
<p>-AA-</p>
<p>Toho Real Estate Co Ltd,</p>
<p>$50 million unsecured with warrants due 2001, guaranteed by Sanwa Bank.</p>
<p>-A-</p>
<p>Hitachi Credit Corp, $200 million unsecured due 2002.  </p>
<p>-BB-</p>
<p>Kawasaki Steel Corp, 10 billion yen unsecured due 2002.</p>
<p>-B-</p>
<p>Ohmori Co Ltd, 4.5 billion euroyen unsecured convertible due 2001.</p>
<p>Sapporo Breweries Ltd,</p>
<p>10 billion yen unsecured due 2002,</p>
<p>10 billion yen unsecured due 2003.  </p>
<p>-CCC-</p>
<p>Kawasaki Kisen Kaisha Ltd, five billion yen unsecured due 2000.</p>
</text>
